[
  {
    "start": 0.102,
    "end": 3.271,
    "text": "Why do AI Agents lose good methods on long tasks?",
    "segmentId": "c01-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.271,
    "end": 4.41,
    "text": "Skills preserve them.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.41,
    "end": 8.344,
    "text": "OpenAI describes skills as reusable, shareable workflows for specific tasks.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 8.344,
    "end": 11.895,
    "text": "A skill can carry a name, instructions, and supporting resources so the next",
    "segmentId": "c01-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 11.895,
    "end": 14.522,
    "text": "run starts from a useful operating pattern rather than a blank chat.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.522,
    "end": 18.303,
    "text": "The loss is familiar: you finally get a good research brief, handoff,",
    "segmentId": "c01-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.303,
    "end": 22.193,
    "text": "analysis, or draft, then reconstruct the same context, constraints, and",
    "segmentId": "c01-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.193,
    "end": 23.084,
    "text": "formatting rules next week.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 23.084,
    "end": 25.903,
    "text": "The result is inconsistency before the real work even begins.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 25.903,
    "end": 30.183,
    "text": "In this video, you will build an AI Agent Skill Template with seven fields:",
    "segmentId": "c01-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.183,
    "end": 34.121,
    "text": "trigger, inputs, workflow, output contract, guardrails, evidence, and",
    "segmentId": "c01-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 34.121,
    "end": 34.323,
    "text": "revision note.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 34.323,
    "end": 36.879,
    "text": "It is small enough to use and explicit enough to inspect.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p04-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.879,
    "end": 40.506,
    "text": "This video is packed with practical, high-value insights to help you get",
    "segmentId": "c01-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 40.506,
    "end": 40.86,
    "text": "better at using AI.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 40.86,
    "end": 44.216,
    "text": "It's a longer one, so follow Tiny Agent and save it so you don't lose it.",
    "segmentId": "c01-p05-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.216,
    "end": 47.77,
    "text": "Start with a task that keeps returning, not with a document you hope people",
    "segmentId": "c02-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 47.77,
    "end": 47.82,
    "text": "Look for a repeat that has a recognizable starting signal.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 47.82,
    "end": 48.3,
    "text": "will read.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.126,
    "end": 54.07,
    "text": "For example, a weekly customer summary starts when fresh notes and product",
    "segmentId": "c02-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.07,
    "end": 54.196,
    "text": "data arrive.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.196,
    "end": 57.51,
    "text": "The skill should describe that trigger, not merely say that it creates",
    "segmentId": "c02-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.51,
    "end": 57.559,
    "text": "A repeatable task has stable intent, even when the source material changes.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.559,
    "end": 58.04,
    "text": "summaries.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 61.061,
    "end": 64.705,
    "text": "If the goal, audience, and success condition are different every time, you",
    "segmentId": "c02-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 64.705,
    "end": 66.921,
    "text": "still have exploration, not a workflow ready to package.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.921,
    "end": 69.088,
    "text": "Do not mistake frequent copying for repeatability.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 69.088,
    "end": 72.653,
    "text": "A copied prompt may contain a useful sentence, but a skill earns its place",
    "segmentId": "c02-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.653,
    "end": 76.22,
    "text": "when the same decisions, checks, and deliverable shape recur across several",
    "segmentId": "c02-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 76.22,
    "end": 76.267,
    "text": "Write the trigger in ordinary language: when a decision-ready update is",
    "segmentId": "c02-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 76.267,
    "end": 76.749,
    "text": "real runs.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.613,
    "end": 80.955,
    "text": "needed from new evidence, use this skill.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 80.955,
    "end": 84.607,
    "text": "That sentence prevents a good workflow from being activated for a nearby but",
    "segmentId": "c02-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.607,
    "end": 84.757,
    "text": "different job.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.757,
    "end": 85.605,
    "text": "Chapter recap.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 85.605,
    "end": 88.879,
    "text": "First, A skill begins with a recurring job, not a generic topic.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 88.879,
    "end": 91.591,
    "text": "Second, The trigger should make clear when the workflow applies.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 91.591,
    "end": 94.279,
    "text": "Third, One-off exploration can remain a conversation.",
    "segmentId": "c02-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 94.279,
    "end": 98.013,
    "text": "A skill should fetch the context that changes the decision, not every detail",
    "segmentId": "c03-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 98.013,
    "end": 98.574,
    "text": "from the last project.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 98.574,
    "end": 100.681,
    "text": "Next, list the inputs that change the answer.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.681,
    "end": 104.692,
    "text": "A source folder, a customer brief, a target audience, a deadline, and an",
    "segmentId": "c03-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 104.692,
    "end": 105.859,
    "text": "approved vocabulary can matter.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 105.859,
    "end": 107.797,
    "text": "Old decorative examples usually do not.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 107.797,
    "end": 110.545,
    "text": "Resources work best when they sit beside the step that needs them.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 110.545,
    "end": 113.347,
    "text": "A research workflow can point to the source standard during evidence",
    "segmentId": "c03-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 113.347,
    "end": 116.034,
    "text": "collection and to the delivery template only when the final brief is",
    "segmentId": "c03-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 116.034,
    "end": 116.15,
    "text": "Make constraints concrete.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 116.15,
    "end": 116.562,
    "text": "assembled.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 117.269,
    "end": 120.487,
    "text": "Instead of saying be careful, specify what must not be invented, which",
    "segmentId": "c03-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.487,
    "end": 123.522,
    "text": "records are authoritative, which action requires approval, and how",
    "segmentId": "c03-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 123.522,
    "end": 124.989,
    "text": "uncertainty should be shown to the reviewer.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.989,
    "end": 126.872,
    "text": "This is also where a skill differs from memory.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.872,
    "end": 129.069,
    "text": "Memory can remember a preference or prior fact.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.069,
    "end": 132.901,
    "text": "A skill tells the Agent which context to retrieve, how to use it, and what",
    "segmentId": "c03-p07-u03",
    "sceneId": "c03-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.901,
    "end": 133.626,
    "text": "to do when it conflicts.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p07-u03",
    "sceneId": "c03-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 133.626,
    "end": 134.487,
    "text": "Chapter recap.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.487,
    "end": 136.926,
    "text": "First, Inputs explain what the Agent can use.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.926,
    "end": 139.297,
    "text": "Second, Constraints explain what it must protect.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 139.297,
    "end": 141.976,
    "text": "Third, References belong beside the step that needs them.",
    "segmentId": "c03-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 141.976,
    "end": 145.013,
    "text": "The heart of a skill is a small sequence of decisions that a capable",
    "segmentId": "c04-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 145.013,
    "end": 146.139,
    "text": "teammate could inspect and challenge.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.139,
    "end": 148.649,
    "text": "Now write the workflow as a short sequence of decisions.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.649,
    "end": 152.274,
    "text": "Begin with the goal, inspect the inputs, identify missing information,",
    "segmentId": "c04-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 152.274,
    "end": 155.207,
    "text": "choose a method, create the draft, and verify the promised outcome.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 155.207,
    "end": 156.942,
    "text": "Each step needs a reason to exist.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.942,
    "end": 160.22,
    "text": "If a step only repeats what the previous step already required, remove it.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p04-u02",
    "sceneId": "c04-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.22,
    "end": 164.199,
    "text": "If a step changes the evidence, the choice, or the handoff, make that change",
    "segmentId": "c04-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 164.199,
    "end": 164.324,
    "text": "Use branches sparingly.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 164.324,
    "end": 164.756,
    "text": "visible.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 165.396,
    "end": 168.918,
    "text": "A useful branch sounds like this: if the source is incomplete, ask for the",
    "segmentId": "c04-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c04-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.918,
    "end": 170.657,
    "text": "missing record and label the draft as provisional.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c04-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 170.657,
    "end": 173.018,
    "text": "It does not try to predict every imaginable exception.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p06-u03",
    "sceneId": "c04-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 173.018,
    "end": 175.398,
    "text": "For high-risk claims, demand an evidence move.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 175.398,
    "end": 179.349,
    "text": "The Agent can cite the record, show a calculation, name an assumption, or",
    "segmentId": "c04-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c04-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 179.349,
    "end": 179.923,
    "text": "ask a human to decide.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c04-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 179.923,
    "end": 182.465,
    "text": "A confident sentence alone is not a verification step.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p07-u03",
    "sceneId": "c04-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.465,
    "end": 183.324,
    "text": "Chapter recap.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 183.324,
    "end": 185.313,
    "text": "First, Separate the goal from the method.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c04-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 185.313,
    "end": 188.103,
    "text": "Second, Write branches only where a real choice exists.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.103,
    "end": 190.73,
    "text": "Third, Ask for evidence when a judgment is high risk.",
    "segmentId": "c04-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 190.73,
    "end": 194.515,
    "text": "A reusable workflow ends with an output another person or Agent can check,",
    "segmentId": "c05-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.515,
    "end": 194.937,
    "text": "edit, and continue.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.937,
    "end": 196.962,
    "text": "A good skill ends with a handoff contract.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.962,
    "end": 200.965,
    "text": "Define the audience, format, required fields, and the decision the output",
    "segmentId": "c05-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c05-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.965,
    "end": 201.252,
    "text": "should support.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c05-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 201.252,
    "end": 204.427,
    "text": "This lets a reviewer check the result without reverse-engineering the",
    "segmentId": "c05-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.427,
    "end": 204.627,
    "text": "original prompt.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.627,
    "end": 206.044,
    "text": "Include an uncertainty rule.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 206.044,
    "end": 209.626,
    "text": "If a source is missing, if two records disagree, or if a decision depends on",
    "segmentId": "c05-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 209.626,
    "end": 212.878,
    "text": "human preference, the output should surface that condition instead of",
    "segmentId": "c05-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 212.878,
    "end": 213.743,
    "text": "burying it in fluent language.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 213.743,
    "end": 215.412,
    "text": "The final check should match the task.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 215.412,
    "end": 217.547,
    "text": "A release note needs factual and link checks.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c05-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 217.547,
    "end": 219.912,
    "text": "A customer message needs audience and permission checks.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p06-u03",
    "sceneId": "c05-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.912,
    "end": 223.15,
    "text": "A plan needs owners, next steps, and unresolved decisions.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p06-u04",
    "sceneId": "c05-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 223.15,
    "end": 224.388,
    "text": "This makes skills shareable.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 224.388,
    "end": 227.773,
    "text": "Another teammate does not need your private intuition to judge whether the",
    "segmentId": "c05-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c05-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 227.773,
    "end": 227.817,
    "text": "run succeeded.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c05-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 227.817,
    "end": 231.729,
    "text": "They can inspect the input, the decisions, the output contract, and the",
    "segmentId": "c05-p07-u03",
    "sceneId": "c05-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 231.729,
    "end": 231.749,
    "text": "Chapter recap.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 231.749,
    "end": 232.247,
    "text": "evidence.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p07-u03",
    "sceneId": "c05-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 232.582,
    "end": 235.525,
    "text": "First, Specify the format before execution starts.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c05-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 235.525,
    "end": 238.044,
    "text": "Second, Make unknowns visible instead of hiding them.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 238.044,
    "end": 240.604,
    "text": "Third, Include a final check that matches the task.",
    "segmentId": "c05-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.604,
    "end": 244.519,
    "text": "Treat a skill as a maintained asset: revise it after failure patterns, not",
    "segmentId": "c06-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 244.519,
    "end": 245.287,
    "text": "after every passing mood.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.287,
    "end": 247.479,
    "text": "Do not freeze a skill after its first success.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.479,
    "end": 250.815,
    "text": "Record the failure pattern that led to a revision: a missing input, a",
    "segmentId": "c06-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 250.815,
    "end": 254.393,
    "text": "misleading default, a weak output field, or a check that looked reassuring",
    "segmentId": "c06-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.393,
    "end": 255.097,
    "text": "but missed the real error.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.097,
    "end": 256.065,
    "text": "Keep the unit small.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 256.065,
    "end": 259.621,
    "text": "One skill can gather evidence, another can turn evidence into a decision",
    "segmentId": "c06-p04-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 259.621,
    "end": 261.177,
    "text": "brief, and a third can run a release check.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p04-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.177,
    "end": 264.494,
    "text": "Smaller skills are easier to understand, test, and recombine.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.494,
    "end": 266.443,
    "text": "Retest after a revision on fresh work.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 266.443,
    "end": 269.857,
    "text": "Replaying the exact example that inspired the skill proves only that you",
    "segmentId": "c06-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 269.857,
    "end": 270.163,
    "text": "preserved the past.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p06-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.163,
    "end": 273.351,
    "text": "A new input reveals whether the instructions carry the right judgment",
    "segmentId": "c06-p06-u03",
    "sceneId": "c06-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 273.351,
    "end": 273.522,
    "text": "When a skill becomes too long, ask which part is truly shared and which part",
    "segmentId": "c06-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 273.522,
    "end": 273.911,
    "text": "forward.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p06-u03",
    "sceneId": "c06-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 277.09,
    "end": 279.771,
    "text": "belongs in a resource, a template, or a separate specialized skill.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.771,
    "end": 282.851,
    "text": "The goal is reliable guidance, not a monument to every past lesson.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p07-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.851,
    "end": 283.711,
    "text": "Chapter recap.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 283.711,
    "end": 286.168,
    "text": "First, Record the failure that justified a revision.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 286.168,
    "end": 289.811,
    "text": "Second, Keep small skills composable rather than creating one giant prompt.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 289.811,
    "end": 292.245,
    "text": "Third, Retest the workflow on a fresh task.",
    "segmentId": "c06-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.245,
    "end": 293.755,
    "text": "The practical sequence is simple.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 293.755,
    "end": 297.332,
    "text": "Capture a real repeat, name the trigger, bring in the context that changes",
    "segmentId": "c07-p01-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 297.332,
    "end": 301.005,
    "text": "decisions, write the few steps that matter, define the handoff, and test the",
    "segmentId": "c07-p01-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 301.005,
    "end": 301.833,
    "text": "result against a fresh case.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p01-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 301.833,
    "end": 305.487,
    "text": "That is how an AI Agent stops replaying your best prompt and starts using a",
    "segmentId": "c07-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 305.487,
    "end": 306.147,
    "text": "maintained working method.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 306.147,
    "end": 308.064,
    "text": "The skill does not make the Agent infallible.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 308.064,
    "end": 311.145,
    "text": "It makes the work easier to inspect, improve, and reuse.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p02-u03",
    "sceneId": "c07-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.145,
    "end": 313.55,
    "text": "Try the template on one small recurring task this week.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 313.55,
    "end": 316.745,
    "text": "Write the trigger in one sentence, attach only the source material that",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 316.745,
    "end": 319.941,
    "text": "changes a decision, name one check a reviewer can actually perform, and",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 319.941,
    "end": 321.998,
    "text": "record one uncertainty that the Agent must not smooth over.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.998,
    "end": 324.128,
    "text": "If that version helps a second real run, keep it.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u03",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 324.128,
    "end": 327.594,
    "text": "If it fails, revise the field that failed instead of adding unrelated",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u04",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 327.594,
    "end": 328.237,
    "text": "instructions everywhere.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u04",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 328.237,
    "end": 329.368,
    "text": "Follow Tiny Agent.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 329.368,
    "end": 331.6,
    "text": "Tiny Agent helps you get better at using AI.",
    "segmentId": "c07-p04-u02",
    "sceneId": "c07-p04"
  }
]
